    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Same bar, same street",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm twenty, but I still feel like fifteen, oh-oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Same fears, same dreams",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Still tryna get my brother to like me, mmm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You said that I always seem to land on my feet",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But I got problems hangin' like a chain 'round my neck",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Tryin', but I'm barely seein' past twenty-three",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And the best of me, right now, is lookin' a lot like a mess",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I thought I had my shit together",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Can't lie, the pills are lookin' temptin', oh-oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I thought that I was gettin' better",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "No, I got better at pretendin', oh-oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
