          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm drunk, oh, wow",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "All my habits came back around",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "\"I'll figure it out,\" that's what I say",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Figure it out and take a break",
